      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "So what was occurred here is that the avatar being worn had not been processed server side yet, currently when being queued for processing this exact case isn't prioritised. Within the open beta it'll wait until something is processed before loading it properly so when there's a backlog for things not prioritised then this issue would appear.\n\nSolution is just to prioritise it, I had planned on doing it after the changes went to live but it seems it may be causing more trouble now so let's do that now",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
